    "name": "Scrive Document Access Control Monitor API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Scrive Document API (eSign Online, Version 2) is a RESTful, JSON-over-HTTPS interface that creates, prepares, sends, and manages the full lifecycle of documents for electronic signing, with identity verification through Nordic and European e-ID methods (BankID, MitID, Freja, Smart-ID, and more). Document status changes are delivered to consumers via HTTP callback (webhook) URLs. Endpoints are grounded in the public documentation at https://apidocs.scrive.com/. Request and response schemas are modeled and should be verified against the live docs.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: API Evangelist\n Email: kin@apievangelist.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
